[[FSE STAGE type=traverse width=12 depth=6]]
[[FSE ENTITY hamlet type=cast pos=0,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY ophelia type=cast pos=1,1]]
[[FSE ENTITY lantern type=prop with=hamlet]]
[[FSE ENTITY ophelia-mark type=mark pos=2,2]]

INT. A ROOM IN THE CASTLE

[[FSE MOVE hamlet pos=-4,0 until=arrive; MOVE ophelia pos=2,2 until=arrive]]

HAMLET
Ha, ha! Are you honest?

OPHELIA
My lord?

HAMLET
Are you fa[[FSE ARRIVE ophelia]]ir?

OPHELIA
What means your lordship?

[[FSE VIA hamlet pos=-2,2]]

HAMLET
That if you be honest and fair, your honesty should
admit no discourse to your beauty.

[[FSE ARRIVE hamlet facing=ophelia-mark]]
[[FSE MOVE hamlet pos=0,0 until=arrive]]
[[FSE VIA hamlet pos=1,0]]
[[FSE ARRIVE hamlet]]
